cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this research repository and identify the exact commit used."
type: software
title: "Heilbronn triangle bounds: finite packings and improved scales"
authors:
  - family-names: Blinov
    given-names: Ivan
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A conditional improvement to the exponent in OpenAI math family 191.
  Includes complete Lean proofs of finite digit packings, exact arithmetic
  certificates, independent arithmetic checks, and source patches.
  The full geometric theorem remains conditional on the pinned upstream
  estimates. Research, implementation and drafting used OpenAI Codex assistance.
keywords:
  - Heilbronn triangle problem
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - exact certificates
  - Behrend construction
